 "personal"}}, {"person_or_org": {"family_name": "Hellendoorn", "given_name": "Vincent", "name": "Hellendoorn, Vincent", "type": "personal"}}, {"person_or_org": {"family_name": "Vasilescu", "given_name": "Bogdan", "name": "Vasilescu, Bogdan", "type": "personal"}}, {"person_or_org": {"family_name": "Myers", "given_name": "Brad", "name": "Myers, Brad", "type": "personal"}}], "description": "\u003cp\u003eThis repository contains the artifacts for the ICSE 2024 technical research paper \"Using an LLM to Help With Code Understanding\"\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThere are two main components in this repository.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/namdy0429/GILT_Artifacts#gilt-generation-based-information-support-with-llm-technology-gilt_artifactsgilt\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eGILT (Generation-based Information-support with LLM Technology):\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/namdy0429/GILT_Artifacts/tree/main/GILT\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003e/GILT_Artifacts/GILT\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHow to install this plugin is included in\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/namdy0429/GILT_Artifacts/blob/main/INSTALL.md\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003e/GILT_Artifacts/Install.md\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/a\u003e, and\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/namdy0429/GILT_Artifacts/blob/main/GILT/overview.png\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003e/GILT_Artifacts/GILT/overview.png\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/namdy0429/GILT_Artifacts/blob/main/GILT/demo.mov\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003eGILT_Artifacts/GILT/demo.mov\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;show how to use GILT.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/namdy0429/GILT_Artifacts#replication-package-for-the-user-study-analysis-gilt_artifactsstudy\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eReplication package for the user study analysis:\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/namdy0429/GILT_Artifacts/tree/main/study\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003e/GILT_Artifacts/Study\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can replicate the statistical analysis included in the paper by running\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/namdy0429/GILT_Artifacts/blob/main/study/analysis.ipynb\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003e/GILT_Artifacts/Study/analysis.ipynb\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUser study result data can be found\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/namdy0429/GILT_Artifacts/blob/main/study/study_data.csv\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003e/GILT_Artifacts/Study/study_data.csv\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/namdy0429/GILT_Artifacts/blob/main/INSTALL.md\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003e/GILT_Artifacts/Install.md\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/a\u003e describes how to set up R-Notebook environment to run this Notebook. Stu\u003c/p\u003e", "publication_date": "2024-01-05", "publisher": "Zenodo", "resource_type": {"id": "software-computationalnotebook", "title": {"de": "Computational Notebook", "en": "Computational notebook"}}, "rights": [{"description": {"en": "A short and simple permissive license with conditions only requiring preservation of copyright and license notices. Licensed works, modifications, and larger works may be distributed under different terms and without source code."}, "id": "mit", "props": {"scheme": "spdx", "url": "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"}, "title": {"en": "MIT License"}}], "title": "Artifacts for Using an LLM to Help With Code Understanding"}, "parent": {"access": {"owned_by": {"user": "76570"}, "settings": {"accept_conditions_text": null, "allow_guest_requests": false, "allow_user_requests": false, "secret_link_expiration": 0}}, "communities": {}, "id": "10461384", "pids": {"doi": {"client": "datacite", "identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.10461384", "provider": "datacite"}}}, "pids": {"doi": {"client": "datacite", "identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.10461385", "provider": "datacite"}, "oai": {"identifier": "oai